Third-party software in Semdok Edge (semdok-edge)
=================================================

semdok-edge is built from the Rust crates listed below. Each is used under the licence shown; the full
licence texts follow. SQLite (bundled through libsqlite3-sys) is in the public domain.
The Windows binary is built with the mingw-w64 toolchain, whose statically linked runtime pieces
are under the Zope Public License 2.1 and public-domain terms.
The Colibri engine is NOT part of this download; when you add it, its own LICENSE, NOTICE and
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md apply. Model weights carry their own licences.

